      "@id": "kt:corresponding-squares",
      "@type": "kto:Technique",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Corresponding squares",
      "skos:definition": "An endgame analysis method that pairs each square of the attacking king with the square or squares the defending king must occupy in reply; the defender holds only by keeping to these matching squares, so the attacker wins by manoeuvring until no corresponding square is available.",
