      "skos:prefLabel": "Triangulation",
      "skos:definition": "An endgame king manoeuvre in which the king walks around three neighbouring squares and so returns to the same position in three moves instead of two, handing the move to an opponent who cannot copy the manoeuvre and is left in zugzwang.",
