      "@id": "kt:elo-rating-system",
      "@type": "kto:RatingSystem",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Elo rating system",
      "skos:definition": "The statistical rating method devised by Arpad Elo and adopted by the US Chess Federation in 1960 and FIDE in 1970, in which each player's rating moves after every rating period by a K-factor times the difference between the actual score and the score the rating difference predicted.",
