      "skos:prefLabel": "Isolated queen's pawn",
      "skos:definition": "A pawn structure in which one side has a d-pawn with no friendly pawns on the c- and e-files; it gives its owner space, open files and central outposts in exchange for a static weakness that can be blockaded and attacked, especially as pieces come off.",
