    {
      "@id": "kt:queens-gambit",
      "@type": "kto:Opening",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Queen's Gambit",
      "skos:definition": "A queen's-pawn opening, 1.d4 d5 2.c4, in which White offers the c-pawn to divert Black's d5-pawn from the centre; because the pawn can usually be regained it is not a true gambit, and Black's main replies are the Slav (2...c6), the Declined (2...e6) and the Accepted (2...dxc4).",
      "kto:domain": "openings",
