      "skos:definition": "An open game arising after 1.e4 e5 2.Nf3 Nc6 3.Bb5, in which White develops the king's bishop to attack the knight that defends e5, preparing quick castling and a later central advance; it is the most frequently played continuation after 1.e4 e5.",
