    {
      "@id": "kt:draw",
      "@type": "kto:Rule",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Draw",
      "skos:definition": "A game of chess that ends with neither player winning, scored as half a point each; under the FIDE Laws it arises from stalemate, a dead position, mutual agreement, a correct repetition or fifty-move claim, the automatic fivefold/75-move rules, or a flag fall when the opponent could not checkmate.",
