      "@id": "kt:threefold-repetition",
      "@type": "kto:Rule",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Threefold repetition",
      "skos:definition": "The FIDE rule that the player on the move may claim a draw when the same position, with the same side to move and the same possible moves, has occurred or is about to occur for at least the third time; a fifth occurrence ends the game automatically.",
