      "@id": "kt:smothered-mate",
      "@type": "kto:MatingPattern",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Smothered mate",
      "skos:definition": "A checkmate, almost always given by a knight, in which the mated king cannot move because every neighbouring square is occupied by its own pieces or pawns; its best-known form, Philidor's legacy, ends with a queen sacrifice that forces a rook to block the king's last escape square.",
      "kto:domain": "tactics",
